                          Runtime Edition

        ZM2 is a Production Process Manager for Node.js applications
                      powered by systemd on Linux.

                Start and manage any application:
                $ zm2 start app.js

                Check running services:
                $ zm2 status

                Make zm2 auto-boot at server restart:
                $ zm2 startup


